        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John D. Rockefeller III, David Rockefeller\n- Family: Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller\n- Companies: Chase Manhattan Corporation\n- Roles: Chairman, Chief Executive, Banker\n\nFacts:\n- David Rockefeller was born on June 12, 1915.\n- John D. Rockefeller III had siblings named Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller, and David Rockefeller.\n- David Rockefeller was an American banker.\n- David Rockefeller served as chairman and chief executive of Chase Manhattan Corporation.\n- David Rockefeller died on March 20, 2017.",
